


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_2388e125:


    "——放学后，四人收拾书包准备回去。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_7fc04c93:



    voice "2HI_1211"
    hina "「小文的手机是不是在响啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_355216f4:


    "阳菜催促着小文从包里拿出手机。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_7203daee:



    voice "2FU_0959"
    fumi "「真的，是我妈妈打来的，找我干嘛呢，店里的事吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_a908fbb9:



    voice "2RI_1244"
    rin "「明天就是情人节当天了。话说会很忙吗？之前应该都买好巧克力了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_09d0e3d2:



    voice "2FU_0960"
    fumi "「卖的最多的确实是在那之前的周日，但当天还是会比平时忙得多」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_37e7396f:



    voice "2RI_1245"
    rin "「这样啊，突击准备那种——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_efadf3eb:



    voice "2FU_0961"
    fumi "「哎？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_79032b02:


    "文忽然喊出声后，表情变得凝重。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_5b311b33:



    voice "2HI_1212"
    hina "「怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_93ba539c:



    voice "2FU_0962"
    fumi "「我妈妈发烧病倒了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_3155fc1e:



    voice "2HI_1213"
    hina "「哎哎！？进医院了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_e06b68ac:



    voice "2FU_0963"
    fumi "「没，倒没严重到那地步，毕竟还能像这样发LIME给我……哈哈」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_9b2ed897:


    "果然还是在担心的吧，笑容很僵硬。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_db07c82c:



    voice "2HI_1214"
    hina "「肯定是因为太劳累」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_e0a4619d:



    voice "2FU_0964"
    fumi "「应该是，她最近这段时间一直在忙」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_dec7164e:


    "在现场亲眼看到母亲工作的二人互相对视确认了下。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_a09125ef:



    voice "2RI_1246"
    rin "「那店里怎么办？刚才不是还说会很忙吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_cace41ee:


    "只有父亲一人肯定忙活不过来的。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_9622c7e4:



    voice "2FU_0965"
    fumi "「那个，我打算明天去店里帮忙」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_01973fed:



    voice "2RI_1247"
    rin "「你的意思是请假1天？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_5fb162d1:


    "文点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_3c4efe2a:



    voice "2MI_0992"
    miyako "「那我来替你记笔记吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_deeffd77:



    voice "2FU_0966"
    fumi "「哇，真的可以拜托你吗，圣夜子？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_711f14fe:



    voice "2MI_0993"
    miyako "「不过没有小文记的笔记好就是了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_96256bb5:



    voice "2FU_0967"
    fumi "「才不会！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_9d15f7c4:



    voice "2HI_1215"
    hina "「我、我也去店里帮忙吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_6e5d33d1:



    voice "2FU_0968"
    fumi "「诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_8b08c636:


    "文被阳菜意料之外的发言惊讶的转身看去。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_484beb11:



    voice "2HI_1216"
    hina "「我刚才也给我爸发了短信，他同意我去了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_87e94347:


    "阳菜这么说着，并拿出手机。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_e8bfebac:



    voice "2RI_1248"
    rin "「动作好快」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_0456445e:



    voice "2FU_0969"
    fumi "「没，但是，那个……虽然这样是帮到我了……但是」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_f7a662e4:


    "看来文不太希望阳菜因为自己缺课。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_86f9889c:



    voice "2HI_1217"
    hina "「前阵子有多忙我都见识过了，小文一个人肯定应付不来的。而且那天也不能关门吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_d031aecc:



    voice "2FU_0970"
    fumi "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_d05d5922:


    "虽然也有经营方面的考虑，更多的还是因为清楚女孩子有多期待情人节。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_85d7ed0a:



    voice "2HI_1218"
    hina "「没事，反正我也得到监护人同意了，而且我爸爸也说一天不上学没什么的，一定要帮到人家」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_1c316160:



    voice "2FU_0971"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_b9b7fcc2:


    "在听到阳菜说了爸爸的话后，文的表情稍微阴沉了些。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_01d9748c:


    "是LIME那件和让阳菜来帮忙这两件事导致的犹豫叠加在一起的影响。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_facac34e:



    voice "2HI_1219"
    hina "「要是知道我放任重要的人像这样苦恼，反而会凶我呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_7ee26761:


    "看来阳菜的仗义是遗传爸爸的。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_034f0aae:



    voice "2RI_1249"
    rin "「好，那我也一起去吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_12ee2a30:



    voice "2HI_1220"
    hina "「你帮不上忙别瞎凑热闹，不来也没关系」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_9c131786:



    voice "2RI_1250"
    rin "「好过分！」"




translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_da7d1278:


    "——放学后，四人收拾书包准备回去。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_fd27843f:


    voice "2RI_1247"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_36719413:


    rin "「你的意思是请假1天？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_1e3ea39d:


    "看来文不太希望阳菜因为自己缺课。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_933a36ee:


    voice "2HI_1218"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_04_c7208a93:


    hina "「没事，反正我也得到监护人同意了，而且我爸爸也说一天不上课没什么的，一定要帮到人家」"
